    "title": "Second Seminole County deputy accused of organized fraud in alleged overtime scheme - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Josh Frigerio ,\n4 hours ago A second Seminole County deputy has been accused of submitting false off-duty overtime time sheets and collecting pay for hours not worked. Deputy Kevin Jones has been charged with one count of organized fraud, the sheriff's office said. An arrest warrant was issued for Jones, who turned himself into the John E. Polk Correctional Facility. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
